# Language Test 202505 - ABC085C: Otoshidama
Sonome kas N kasta Y tas Kisite kas readints vis 2.
Sonome kas found tas Jatuni.
Sonome kas ax tas -1.
Sonome kas ay tas -1.
Sonome kas az tas -1.
Sonome kas z tas 0.
Pilike kas x pas Kisite kas pilika vis N + 1 {
    Palusta kix found {
        Pilike kas y pas Kisite kas pilika vis N - x + 1 {
            Palusta kix found {
                Kemese kas z tas N - x - y.
                Palusta 10000 * x + 5000 * y + 1000 * z kate Y {
                    Kemese kas ax tas x.
                    Kemese kas ay tas y.
                    Kemese kas az tas z.
                    Kemese kas found tas Tuni.
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
Takute kas [ax, ay, az] vis " ".
